  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BBC Media Action, Tikambe II - Tikambe II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BBC Media Action, Tikambe II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BBC Media Action har ans&#xf6;kt om 21,685,500 SEK fr&#xe5;n Sida f&#xf6;r att kunna genomf&#xf6;ra projektet &#x201d;Tikambe Re-Loaded Project&#x201d; i Zambia (Lusaka, Centrala, Kopparb&#xe4;ltet och Norra provinsen) under perioden 2017-2020. Insatsen syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra ungas tillg&#xe4;nglighet till SRHR-information samt tillhandah&#xe5;lla, tillg&#xe4;ngligg&#xf6;ra och &#xf6;ka upptaget av SRH-tj&#xe4;nster riktade mot unga. P&#xe5; grund av unga m&#xe4;nniskors begr&#xe4;nsade tillg&#xe5;ng till SRHR-information- och tj&#xe4;nster &#xe4;r denna grupp s&#xe5;rbar i relation till ett antal risker, s&#xe5;som sexuellt &#xf6;verf&#xf6;rbara sjukdomar, HIV och o&#xf6;nskade graviditeter, n&#xe5;got som denna insats avser adressera. 

Projektets budget &#xe4;r 21,685,500 SEK, Sida finansierar hela beloppet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BBC Media Action has applied to Sida for funding of 21,685,500 SEK to carry out the &quot;Tikambe Re-Loaded Project&#x201d; in Zambia (Lusaka, Central, Copperbelt and Northern provinces) during the period 2017-2020. The intervention aims at improving access to SRHR information for young people as well as the provision, access and uptake of youth-friendly SRHR services. It is intended to address limited SRHR information and services for young people which leave young people exposed to numerous risks in terms of sexually transmitted infections, HIV and unwanted pregnancies. 

The intervention&#x2019;s total budget is 21,685,500 SEK, Sida will fund the entire budget.</narrative>
  </description>
